001300 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001400 PROGRAM-ID.    USB110.
001500 AUTHOR.        SUZUKI.
001600 DATE-WRITTEN.  1997-02-10.
001700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001900 SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
002000 OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
002100 DATA DIVISION.
002200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002300 01  WK-AREA.
002400     03  WK-RITU             PIC 9(02).
002500     03  WK-ZEI-W            PIC S9(09)V99  COMP-3.
002600     03  WK-ZEI-S            PIC S9(09)     COMP-3.
002700 LINKAGE SECTION.
002800 01  ZP-AREA.
002900     03  ZP-DATE                 PIC 9(08).
003000     03  ZP-KIN                  PIC S9(11)    COMP-3.
003100     03  ZP-KEIGEN               PIC X(01).
003200     03  ZP-HASU                 PIC X(01).
003300     03  ZP-RITU                 PIC 9(02).
003400     03  ZP-KBN                  PIC X(01).
003500     03  ZP-ZEI                  PIC S9(09)    COMP-3.
003600     03  ZP-RC                   PIC 9(02).
003700 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ZP-AREA.
003800 ZEI-MAIN.
003900     MOVE ZERO TO ZP-ZEI ZP-RC WK-RITU.
004000     MOVE '1' TO ZP-KBN.
004100* 2014.02 改修 佐藤
004200     IF ZP-DATE >= 20191001
004300        GO TO ZEI-10-RTN.
004400     IF ZP-DATE >= 20140401
004500        GO TO ZEI-08-RTN.
004600     GO TO ZEI-05-RTN.
004700*
004800 ZEI-03-RTN.
004900     MOVE 3 TO WK-RITU.
005000     GO TO ZEI-KEISAN.
005100*
005200 ZEI-05-RTN.
005300     MOVE 5 TO WK-RITU.
005400     GO TO ZEI-KEISAN.
005500*
005600 ZEI-08-RTN.
005700     MOVE 8 TO WK-RITU.
005800     GO TO ZEI-KEISAN.
005900*
006000* 2019.08 改修 佐藤 軽減税率
006100 ZEI-10-RTN.
006200     IF ZP-KEIGEN = '1'
006300        MOVE 8   TO WK-RITU
006400        MOVE '2' TO ZP-KBN
006500     ELSE
006600        MOVE 10  TO WK-RITU.
006700     GO TO ZEI-KEISAN.
006800*
006900 ZEI-KEISAN.
007000     MOVE WK-RITU TO ZP-RITU.
007100     COMPUTE WK-ZEI-W = ZP-KIN * WK-RITU / 100.
007200*    端数処理
007300     IF ZP-HASU = '2'
007400        COMPUTE ZP-ZEI ROUNDED = WK-ZEI-W
007500        GO TO ZEI-END.
007600     IF ZP-HASU = '3'
007700        MOVE WK-ZEI-W TO WK-ZEI-S
007800        IF WK-ZEI-W > WK-ZEI-S
007900           COMPUTE ZP-ZEI = WK-ZEI-S + 1
008000           GO TO ZEI-END
008100        ELSE
008200           MOVE WK-ZEI-S TO ZP-ZEI
008300           GO TO ZEI-END.
008400     MOVE WK-ZEI-W TO ZP-ZEI.
008500*
008600 ZEI-END.
008700     EXIT PROGRAM.
